    body='''<section class="premium-intro"><div><span class="premium-label">ANALYSIS PREMIUM</span><h2>Go deeper into market preparation.</h2><p>A dedicated membership for premium analysis and event guides.</p><a class="button premium-button" href="#premium-details">Explore membership plans →</a></div></section><section id="premium-details"><p class="eyebrow">MEMBERSHIP PLANS · COMING SOON</p><h2>Choose monthly or annual access</h2><div class="premium-plans analysis-plans"><article class="premium-plan"><span class="premium-label">1 Month</span><h3>One month of Analysis Premium</h3><p class="package-price">$29<span>per month</span></p><p>Total: $29 for one month of access.</p><p class="meta">Enrollment is not open yet.</p></article><article class="premium-plan featured"><span class="premium-label">Annual · Save 41%</span><h3>A full year of Analysis Premium</h3><p class="package-price">$17<span>per month equivalent</span></p><p>Total: $204 paid upfront for one year of access.</p><p class="meta">Enrollment is not open yet.</p></article></div></section><section class="premium-delivery"><h2>Membership is being prepared</h2><p>Member accounts and protected article access are not live yet. Payments for Analysis Premium are not currently accepted.</p><p>Planned payment methods: PayPal and USDT. Renewal and payment instructions will be available when enrollment opens.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/analysis/">Read the free analysis guides →</a></section><section><h2>Looking for the Trader’s Kit?</h2><p>The book and community packages are a separate purchase and do not include this Analysis membership.</p><a href="/vip/">View the existing Trader’s Kit →</a></section>'''+quote
